 a casual game mode with other chimps. You can also go shopping and get new Clothes and Hats and More! Welcome to GoofyOofer! Play now for free.", "short_description": "GoofyOofer is a Multiplayer Horror VR Game where you play as a Chimp and can only move with your hands with NO LEGS!! You also have lots of opportunities like exploring a cave with monsters inside and going deeper inside down to a secret lab with more monsters, you can also play TAG with other Chimps! or just be in a casual game mode with other chimps. You can also go shopping and get new Clothes and Hats and More! Welcome to GoofyOofer! Play now for free."}]}, "developer_name": "The Landons Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/b1043236-33a0-42a1-b8fa-c2cdd53b0010", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jon Landon", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thelandonsstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9403105783035903"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75622023_449960574812677_2366275862884993303_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KGlJ5uR-F_sQ7kNvwGGK_G2&_nc_oc=AdqNsmhSounzNWEtuVhFKspjVtLDkft8RWpaIjS3JqMa5ShAeL4xfONQqhZj0m-7Djk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-